      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're feeling immense pressure to maintain a certain standard, which is an exhausting burden to carry. Instead of fighting the feeling of decay, perhaps you could embrace the act of simply *observing* it, giving yourself permission to be imperfect. You don't have to produce masterpieces right now; try writing purely for your own sake without any external goal or judgment. That act of honest, low-stakes creation can often be a powerful antidote to self-criticism.",
